"90930fa21a726a872362f8cd3bcbaca6ef506b5c"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1228": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew Osmond \u003caosmond@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2041373.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D301919\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D302419\n", "files": ["dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegVideoDecoder.cpp", "dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegVideoDecoder.h"], "git_node": "926e609fe6c4028664271b61bfc54a0899adf4fa", "git_parents": ["90930fa21a726a872362f8cd3bcbaca6ef506b5c"], "node": "e0b98d214cf40b0a78a32b203a78048d30546e88", "parents": ["2b575add50d6e8698831de1311723fd7b9e252d2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1780539839, "git_changesets": ["926e609fe6c4028664271b61bfc54a0899adf4fa"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1229": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jed Davis \u003cjld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2040477.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D302076\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304630\n", "files": ["security/sandbox/linux/broker/SandboxBrokerRealpath.cpp"], "git_node": "be1240b0e09c8bc37303caa616924ada92b6effa", "git_parents": ["926e609fe6c4028664271b61bfc54a0899adf4fa"], "node": "342e3c73a216f2bfd1e778cc03bf2d7b6a6db88f", "parents": ["e0b98d214cf40b0a78a32b203a78048d30546e88"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jed Davis \u003cjld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2040515 - Rip out the symlink brokering.  a=RyanVM\n\nThis is almost certainly unused.  Bug 1380701 comment #23 mentioned\nPulseAudio in content processes, which is no longer supported.  (If\nyou flip `media.cubeb.sandbox` for testing, you'll need to turn off\nsandboxing; you should not flip that pref for production use.)\n\nIn general there are very few places left where sandboxed processes can\ncreate files, and none of them should need symlinks.  However, there\nmight be libraries which were calling symlink and silently failing.\n\nGiven all of that, this patch does not return symlink/symlinkat to being\nunexpected syscalls (crash on Nightly, ENOSYS otherwise) but instead just\nmakes them quietly fail with EPERM.  (This happens to match macOS, it's a\nreasonable error code, and tests can distinguish it from the EACCES of a\nbroker rejection.)\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D301463\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304650\n", "files": ["security/sandbox/common/test/SandboxTestingChildTests.h", "security/sandbox/linux/SandboxBrokerClient.cpp", "security/sandbox/linux/SandboxBrokerClient.h", "security/sandbox/linux/SandboxFilter.cpp", "security/sandbox/linux/broker/SandboxBroker.cpp", "security/sandbox/linux/broker/SandboxBrokerCommon.cpp", "security/sandbox/linux/broker/SandboxBrokerCommon.h", "security/sandbox/linux/gtest/TestBroker.cpp", "security/sandbox/test/browser_content_sandbox_fs_tests.js"], "git_node": "abc1331697b9fcb5558d814c6b680e354f7349b2", "git_parents": ["be1240b0e09c8bc37303caa616924ada92b6effa"], "node": "f16d0a5070bc61bea2094b62ba074b9db5f438fa", "parents": ["342e3c73a216f2bfd1e778cc03bf2d7b6a6db88f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jed Davis \u003cjld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2040177.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D302075\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304651\n", "files": ["security/sandbox/linux/broker/SandboxBroker.cpp", "security/sandbox/linux/broker/SandboxBrokerCommon.h"], "git_node": "67a770b8004be87139a1e16a1b0fa2d66eb8b088", "git_parents": ["abc1331697b9fcb5558d814c6b680e354f7349b2"], "node": "15a320b078899a99fc1176f11a3fb0cc9666afbe", "parents": ["f16d0a5070bc61bea2094b62ba074b9db5f438fa"], "tags": []}], "date": 1780544954, "git_changesets": ["be1240b0e09c8bc37303caa616924ada92b6effa", "abc1331697b9fcb5558d814c6b680e354f7349b2", "67a770b80