 Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304681\n", "files": ["gfx/angle/checkout/out/gen/angle/angle_commit.h", "gfx/angle/checkout/src/compiler/translator/ParseContext.cpp", "gfx/angle/cherry_picks.txt"], "git_node": "16e2395afd873ef2e9e54498b76bff111279cb6a", "git_parents": ["f56f75177ed727d23943a4c00f9d5de7a2c5ce20"], "node": "46b93760091420e33184654accdef7106e73d7e1", "parents": ["8a4b52a65a66a257f89d2eda3ef3c0545742cf6e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1780576559, "git_changesets": ["9bcca322b563d2482b48cbaeb4d0fc788c7c381b", "f56f75177ed727d23943a4c00f9d5de7a2c5ce20", "16e2395afd873ef2e9e54498b76bff111279cb6a"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1233": {"changesets": [{"author": "Olli Pettay \u003cOlli.Pettay@helsinki.fi\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2043139 - don't try to over-optimize some getter/function calls, esr, r=jandem,emilio a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304190\n", "files": ["dom/webidl/Document.webidl", "dom/webidl/Element.webidl", "dom/webidl/HTMLElement.webidl", "dom/webidl/HTMLInputElement.webidl"], "git_node": "aaf48481666fe7941231f09cb479c2619228018e", "git_parents": ["16e2395afd873ef2e9e54498b76bff111279cb6a"], "node": "fea8b5fbd90651db3b44759fe296bbf32e5289b4", "parents": ["46b93760091420e33184654accdef7106e73d7e1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1780576868, "git_changesets": ["aaf48481666fe7941231f09cb479c2619228018e"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1234": {"changesets": [{"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2044738 - cherry-pick upstream libwebrtc commit 8b69cb6bae r=ng a=RyanVM\n\n[M135] Support negative SenderCaptureTimeOffset in TransformableVideoFrameInterface\n\nSince the offset can be negative, use the signed version of the\nQ32.32 conversion function.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 74c5a213ad5f5b27678d021c9f97590c11471c74)\n\nBug: chromium:400654629\nFixed: chromium:400891471\nChange-Id: I953f68495a399078294326694161ea1a82969a52\nReviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/379740\nCommit-Queue: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\nCr-Original-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#44041}\nNo-Try: True\nReviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/380081\nReviewed-by: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@webrtc.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/branch-heads/7049@{#1}\nCr-Branched-From: caae8ec03bedd938b99c7a11b6455878c4f93e75-refs/heads/main@{#44027}\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304526\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/audio/channel_receive_frame_transformer_delegate.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/channel_receive_frame_transformer_delegate_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_video_stream_receiver_frame_transformer_delegate.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_video_stream_receiver_frame_transformer_delegate_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "e699395d4fdcdaba5121105650c68e102596c922", "git_parents": ["aaf48481666fe7941231f09cb479c2619228018e"], "node": "58cab8473224b81894cfbc81e9ffeca815a549ac", "parents": ["fea8b5fbd90651db3b44759fe296bbf32e5289b4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2044738 - cherry-pick upstream libwebrtc commit 04413d62f7 r=ng a=RyanVM\n\nPipeWire capture: Clean latest_available_frame on capture stop\n\nOnce we stop capturing, we clear the queue with frames, but we still\nkeep pointer to the latest available frame. This latest available frame\nshould be invalidated, otherwise it will be now pointing to non-existent\nframe. This is not a problem when we completely stop capturing, but if\nwe are just restarting it to pick a different source, we can crash on it\nif we are asked to provide a frame, but we didn't get any yet from the\nnew source.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 576ec5a272658bead30d36a992fa579c9b36f62c)\n\nBug: chromium:400656070\nChange-Id: I780392999ebba917aa72dde8a2c9b77bfc21cd0f\nReviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/379920\nReviewed-by: Alexander Cooper \u003calcooper@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Jan Grulich \u003cgrulja@gmail.com\u003e\nCr-Original-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#44084}\nReviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/382621\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/branch-heads/7049@{#2}\nCr-Branched-From: caae8ec03bedd938b99c7a11b6455878c4f93e75-refs/heads/main@{#44027}\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304527\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/modules/desktop_capture/linux/wayland/shared_screencast_stream.cc"], "git_node": "77850190d835d16c4cbc290f3061a94ffbcdb090", "git_parents": ["e699395d4fdcdaba5121105650c68e102596c922"], "node": "cee146e2db28269753c4c07fa8a43b978c9c4c11", "parents": ["58cab8473224b81894cfbc81e9ffeca815a549ac"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2044738 - cherry-pick upstream libwebrtc commit 9e5db68b15 r=ng a=RyanVM\n\n[M135] Protect queue in FrameInstrumentationGenerator with a mutex\n\n`OnCapturedFrame` and `OnEncodedImage` may be called from different\nthreads, hence synchronization is needed. There have been reports of crashes caused by race condition: https://issues.chromium.org/issues/404925575\n\n// No-Try due to iwyu_verifier seemingly not working on this branch.\n(cherry picked from commit 4447d6b800c1af20955844f082e1cb29158a7790)\n\nNo-Try: True\nBug: webrtc:358039777, chromium:404925575\nChange-Id: I070b9b7309c28ab50de2268af55adbe26e559f6f\nReviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/383021\nReviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Fanny Linderborg \u003clinderborg@webrtc.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Fanny Linderborg \u003clinderborg@webrtc.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\nCr-Original-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#44268}\nReviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/385083\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/branch-heads/7049@{#3}\nCr-Branched-From: caae8ec03bedd938b99c7a11b6455878c4f93e75-refs/heads/main@{#44027}\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304528\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/video/corruption_detection/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/corruption_detection/frame_instrumentation_generator.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/corruption_detection/frame_instrumentation_generator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/corruption_detection/frame_instrumentation_generator_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "c846d9ad1e39c19a5779b0601c439783c1bbbd2a", "git_parents": ["77850190d835d16c4cbc290f3061a94ffbcdb090"], "node": "79db5b989fbe305977f98e978c0108b58b71f239", "parents": ["cee146e2db28269753c4c07fa8a43b978c9c4c11"], "tags": []}], "date": 1780577492, "git_changesets": ["e699395d4fdcdaba5121105650c68e102596c922", "77850190d835d16c4cbc290f3061a94ffbcdb090", "c846d9ad1e39c19a5779b0601c439783c1bbbd2a"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1235": {"changesets": [{"author": "Julian Descottes \u003cjdescottes@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2038133 - [devtools] Consistently show filepicker on first save action from StyleEditor  a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304742\n", "files": ["devtools/client/styleeditor/StyleSheetEditor.sys.mjs", "devtools/client/styleeditor/test/browser_styleeditor_filesave.js", "devtools/client/styleeditor/test/browser_styleeditor_sourcemap_watching.js"], "git_node": "a7ebd2dc02699190bccc7347e827a0eb07641ca4", "git_parents": ["c846d9ad1e39c19a5779b0601c439783c1bbbd2a"], "node": "2c3771cb576abfe1d8f83ebef6b7355d93d4b8c1", "parents": ["79db5b989fbe305977f98e978c0108b58b71f239"], "tags": []}], "date": 1780613742, "git_changesets": ["a7ebd2dc02699190bccc7347e8